Supervisor: Oh, you’re the new hire! I’m your supervisor.
Supervisor: Lemme tell you a story back when our president Mr. Angilo started this whole gig.
Supervisor: This place wasn't even called Angeloan. It was just a small rural micro-lending office down the street.
Supervisor: Paper-to-pixel, man. We digitized everything last year to scale up, but the old man’s core rule never changed.
